72
00:03:02,830 --> 00:03:04,150
And so it only returns

73
00:03:04,150 --> 00:03:07,870
to when both values are exactly the same.

74
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:08,703
On the other hand,

75
00:03:08,703 --> 00:03:11,240
